2026-07-27T09:27:52.8138041Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T09:27:52.8138572Z i /tmp/RtmpP9nuUE/duckdb
2026-07-27T09:27:52.8138903Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T09:27:52.8139274Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T09:27:52.8139640Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T09:27:52.8140122Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T09:27:52.8140818Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T09:27:52.8141747Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
